  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Shanghai Area Airspace And Ground Optimization Technical Assistance Program Federal Aviation Administration (Faa) Transfer Funds, through U.S. Chamber of Commerce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA&apos;s funding supports a Shanghai Area Airspace and Ground Optimization Technical Assistance Program for the Civil Aviation Administration of China (CAAC). The project, developed in close cooperation with the Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) and member companies of the U.S.-China Aviation Cooperation Program, is assisting CAAC to improve airspace capacity at the local, regional, and national system level, as well as to integrate airport planning with air carrier operations and air traffic procedures.</narrative>
  </description>
